---
export const prerender = true;
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
  <meta name="description" content="Motto Immortal Database has closed permanently. A farewell and thank-you to the community." />
  <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" />
  <title>Motto Immortal Database has closed</title>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="closed">
    <p class="eyebrow">A farewell to the community</p>
    <h1>Motto Immortal Database<br />has closed for good.</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      To everyone who used this site: thank you. I'm sorry to tell you that it
      is no longer available and will not be run any further.
    </p>

    <div class="body">
      <p>
        The publisher of Motto Immortal raised a copyright objection against this
        fan project. I respect their rights, and I don't want to put myself or
        the community in a difficult position, so I have decided to withdraw the
        site completely. All heroes, tier lists, guides, calculators and tools
        have been taken offline, and they will not return elsewhere.
      </p>
      <p>
        I'm not writing this lightly. This project was a labour of love, built
        on my own in my free time because I enjoy this game and wanted to make
        it a little easier for all of us to understand and enjoy. Every hero
        page, every rating and every guide carried a lot of care.
      </p>
      <p>
        What made it worth doing was you. Every message, every correction, every
        suggestion and every kind word about how the information helped your
        team or your decisions made my day. Knowing that this was useful to real
        players was the best part of the whole project, and I'm truly grateful
        for it.
      </p>
      <p>
        I'm very sad to end it this way. Thank you for your support, your
        feedback and your trust. I hope you keep enjoying Motto Immortal, and
        each other's company in the community.
      </p>
    </div>

    <p class="sign">With heartfelt thanks,<br /><strong>the creator of Motto Immortal Database</strong></p>

    <hr />

    <p class="note">
      Motto Immortal Database was an unofficial, non-commercial fan project and
      was never affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by the game's
      developer or publisher. All game names, artwork and trademarks belong to
      their respective owners.
    </p>
  </main>
</body>
</html>

<style is:global>
  :root {
    --bg-base: #07060c;
    --text-bright: #f4f1ff;
    --text-primary: #e6e6eb;
    --text-secondary: rgba(230, 230, 235, 0.72);
    --text-muted: rgba(230, 230, 235, 0.45);
    --accent-gold: #facc15;
    --accent-purple-dim: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.15);
    --border-subtle: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  }

  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

  body {
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 48px 20px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 40% at 50% 0%, var(--accent-purple-dim), transparent 70%),
      var(--bg-base);
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-family: "Inter", system-ui, sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .closed { width: 100%; max-width: 580px; }

  .eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent-gold);
  }

  .closed h1 {
    font-size: clamp(30px, 6vw, 44px);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--text-bright);
  }

  .lead { margin-top: 20px; font-size: 18px; color: var(--text-bright); }

  .body { margin-top: 28px; display: grid; gap: 16px; color: var(--text-secondary); }

  .sign { margin-top: 28px; color: var(--text-primary); }
  .sign strong { color: var(--text-bright); font-weight: 600; }

  .closed hr { margin: 36px 0 24px; border: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); }

  .note { font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-muted); }
</style>
